  "content": "<h3>&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N7KuPsI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"763\" height=\"149\"></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JnRtoDNfJhs\" width=\"708\" height=\"417\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fsaltywateroriginal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mRKyDfR.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"124\"></a></p><p>摸摸大猫猫，给我买杯咖啡吧！&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>注意：</strong></span> 如果这个模组对您无效，请尝试更换玩家动画器版本。</p><h2>仅凭一个按键，你能表达多少自我？ &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</h2><p>Sitting+ 是一款情境化坐姿模组。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>使用此模组，您可以通过按下 X 键在任何地方坐下：</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EX44BKW.gif\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>您可以切换姿势，以更好地适应环境氛围或角色扮演需求：</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PAEz7ok.gif\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>您可以坐在栅栏上：</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZouwpUV.gif\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>（支持可切换姿势）</p><p>您可以放松休息：</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/P63ZXbD.gif\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>（支持可切换姿势）</p><p>&nbsp;或坐在楼梯/台阶上：</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DlGc4d9.gif\"></p><p>（支持可切换姿势）</p><h6><strong>（触发姿势时必须保持完全静止）</strong></h6><p>&nbsp;</p><p>手持物品坐下会触发该物品的专属姿势。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZZG7S4Z.gif\"></p><p>...</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LMXzqfS.gif\"></p><p>...</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/10kwN2n.gif\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;（但您基本上可以使用背包中的任何物品触发专属姿势，一旦触发物品姿势，只需切换到其他物品即可。）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>以下是 Syx Games 制作的精彩短片，展示了 Sitting+ 如何提升任何《我的世界》媒体内容的表现力：<br><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3KVd-W2Vvz8\" width=\"703\" height=\"414\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>这是 Enderverse 频道展示此模组、我的模组及其他模组协同效果的精彩视频：</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6KpGUbnCGNs?lc=UgysLncMt7Y_GAAdqVB4AaABAg\" width=\"742\" height=\"416\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>如视频所示，我强烈建议您将此模组与第一人称模组（如真实相机模组）或第三人称模组（如更好的第三人称模组）搭配使用。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">有酷炫的姿势创意吗？请在评论区告诉我或私信我！！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本模组需要玩家动画器 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>所有项目现已发布于：</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fsaltywater\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p1YdKLT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"50\"></a></p><p>若想在整合包中使用此模组，或在视频中展示本模组，敬请自便。请私信我相关链接，以便我也能体验整合包或观看视频。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>请别忘了查看我的其他模组，任何反馈都将备受感激。</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salty-s-realistic-forging\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YM3h2s3.png\" alt=\"真实锻造\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pickuptorches\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FyTh6pm.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simplywalk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UckeY7D.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jumpanimation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m1WGasZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trashbinned\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CiRnH8e.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/find-the-treasure\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y37f1GQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simplysneak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I8WXCEp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftingtakestime\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962260/description_c05e2ade-ee28-45b2-93e5-93859f4a2265.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#169179\">我也制作 Vintage Story 模组！可在此查看：<a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.vintagestory.at%252flist%252fmod%253fsortby%253dlastreleased%2526sortdir%253ddesc%2526text%253d%2526side%253d%2526userid%253d20368%2526mv%253d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SaltyWater</a></span></strong></p><p>祝安好。</p>",
